UPDATE ar_ling_root_asl SET note_md = 'Marker: head sense. Corrected: old quote was a grammar note on بطرت معيشتها. Was: «أصله: بطرت معيشته، فصرف عنه الفعل ونصب، ويقارب البطر الطرب، وهو خطّة أكثر ما تعت». Primary: most books head with reckless pride / exultation over blessings (al-Khalīl, al-Jawharī, Lisān, Miṣbāḥ, Qāmūs, Tāj, Lane), as al-Rāghib''s row; splitting (Ibn Fāris, Ibn Durayd) is the minority. (re-checked 2026-10-07)', updated_at = datetime('now')
